      "text": "Torotoro – El Vergel Canyon – Cochabamba"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:d1bf136a4a3c936a",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "8297403cf7408e064bb12e088a5dceb86c169c520e1ecb7b7aa00131873ed19e",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-mw96kqoe-lg4q4klwz6",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "The tour continues in El Vergel Canyon. Follow a narrow trail down into the canyon, where the walls reach about 300 m in height. Water and erosion have shaped them over the years.\n\nAfter the walk, have lunch in El Vergel. Then return to Cochabamba in a comfortable vehicle, with arrival expected at around 16:00."
